  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The rear extension would include the the construction or provision of a raised platform to facilitate the construction of the single storey rear extension. The proposal would not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, A.1(k) (i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed rear extension would be within 2 metres of the boundary on the proposed elevations and would have an eaves height higher than the permissible 3 metres. The proposal would not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, A.1(i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal would project greater than 3m in depth off the original rear elevation and thereby fail to accord with the tolerances outlined in Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, A.1 (f) i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
